  "keyFeatures": [
    "One OpenAI-compatible endpoint routing to 350+ AI providers",
    "90+ free-tier providers — ~1.51B free tokens/month with zero config",
    "19 routing strategies including priority, weighted, round-robin, and LKGP",
    "12-engine token compression pipeline saving 15–95% of tokens (RTK + Caveman)",
    "Quota-aware auto-fallback with 3-layer resilience (circuit breaker, cooldown, model lockout)",
    "MCP server with 110 tools for IDE and agent integrations (Claude Desktop, Cursor)",
    "A2A (Agent-to-Agent) protocol via JSON-RPC 2.0 + SSE",
    "Full CLI with 80+ commands, interactive TUI chat, and remote mode",
    "Desktop app (Electron), PWA, Docker, and Termux support",
    "Semantic cache, cost tracking, webhooks, and memory/skills system"
  ],
